#: input:54 standard
msgid ""
"Note: Consumed wares are approximated by subtracting remaining from "
"produced, because neither it, nor starting stock is available directly."
msgstr ""
"Vermark: Bruukt Waren worden umslags berekent, indeem Waren Över vun "
"Produzeert Waren oftrucken worden, denn nich dat un ok de Anfangs-Bestand is "
"nich stracks erfaat."

#: input:57 standard
msgid ""
"Note: Consumed wares include lost and destroyed wares too, because it is not "
"available directly, so it is calculated by subtracting remaining from "
"produced + starting."
msgstr ""
"Vermark: Bruukt Waren umfaat ok verloren un verneelte Waren, denn dat is "
"nich stracks erfaat, also word dat berekent, indeem Waren Över vun "
"Produzeert + Anfangs oftrucken word."

